  "description": "MiaAI-Lab GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks on two GB10 Sparks: vLLM TP2 over ConnectX with EXL3/TR3 4bpw routed experts, fp8_ds_mla KV, and a DFlash2 k=7 speculator. Three decode speed-ups ship OFF by default and a fresh clone runs without them; enabling GLM53_ADAPTIVE_K=ema (adaptive verification length, lossless at temperature 0) and GLM53_DENSE_FP8=dense,kda took measured single-stream decode from 24.9 to 32.8 tok/s, all of it step time (125.2 -> 95.2 ms) with acceptance unchanged at 3.12 tokens per step. Context is 500,000 rather than the recipe default 850,000 because EXL3 weights plus the DFlash2 draft leave ~12.9 GiB for KV on this kit; 850k needs 13.46 GiB and fails to allocate.",
